-> start

=== start ===
I am the governor. It is my custom to release one prisoner to the crowd at the festival. I gave them a choice: Barabbas, a murderer and insurrectionist, or this "king of the Jews."
* [Why did you offer them Jesus?] -> choice

=== choice ===
I found no basis for a charge against him. My wife even sent me a message, "Don't have anything to do with that innocent man." I thought the crowd would see reason.
* [What did they choose?] -> result

=== result ===
They shouted for Barabbas. They wanted the revolutionary, not the peacemaker. I washed my hands of it. His blood is on their hands, not mine.
-> DONE